:: NewSpellSystem

    Here I am creating a new spell system for testing. A slightly dumbed down version to speed up the design and flavor of the magic system. I will be keeping the custom spell system, but its uses will be limited to crafting your own spells at "home", saving them, and then being able to make use of them in the field. Let us get started then...

    You know, I'm still not sure about this. Looking over the code I have already built for the spell crafting system, the interconnectivity of it, the amount of system checks that lead everywhere... It is complex, but the foundation is complete. I am sure there is a better and more centralized way to manage a ton of its checks/balances, even if I'm not seeing it yet, but still, its all there. I need to make a decision on this, its holding up developement.

